  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Babban Gona Farmer Services Nigeria Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Babban Gona is an innovative agricultural business in Nigeria. It builds smallholder farmer groups and provides them with end-to-end services, using a franchise model which leverages its proprietary advanced technology platform. These include agricultural inputs, financing, training and education as well as harvest and marketing services. Through this model, Babban Gona significantly improves the profitability and income levels of smallholder farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
